"Optional, for older browsers: the YouTube ID for the 1.25x speed video."
msgstr ""
"Opsioneel, vir ouer blaaiers: die YouTube-ID vir die 1,25x-spoedvideo."

#: video_xfields.py:47
msgid "YouTube ID for 1.25x speed"
msgstr "YouTube ID vir 1,25x spoed"

#: video_xfields.py:52
