msgstr "Opsioneel, vir ouer blaaiers: die YouTube-ID vir die 1,5x-spoedvideo."

#: video_xfields.py:53
msgid "YouTube ID for 1.5x speed"
msgstr "YouTube ID vir 1,5x spoed"

#: video_xfields.py:59
msgid ""
"Time you want the video to start if you don't want the entire video to play."
" Not supported in the native mobile app: the full video file will play. "
"Formatted as HH:MM:SS. The maximum value is 23:59:59."
msgstr ""
"Tyd wat jy wil hê die video moet begin as jy nie wil hê dat die hele video "
"moet speel nie. Word nie in die inheemse mobiele toepassing ondersteun nie: "
"die volledige videolêer sal speel. Geformateer as HH:MM:SS. Die maksimum "
"waarde is 23:59:59."

#: video_xfields.py:63
msgid "Video Start Time"
msgstr "Video begin tyd"

#: video_xfields.py:69
msgid ""
"Time you want the video to stop if you don't want the entire video to play. "
"Not supported in the native mobile app: the full video file will play. "
"Formatted as HH:MM:SS. The maximum value is 23:59:59."
msgstr ""
"Tyd wat jy wil hê die video moet stop as jy nie wil hê die hele video moet "
"speel nie. Word nie in die inheemse mobiele toepassing ondersteun nie: die "
"volledige videolêer sal speel. Geformateer as HH:MM:SS. Die maksimum waarde "
"is 23:59:59."

#: video_xfields.py:73
msgid "Video Stop Time"
msgstr "Video Stop Tyd"

#: video_xfields.py:81
msgid ""
"Allow students to download versions of this video in different formats if "
"they cannot use the edX video player or do not have access to YouTube. You "
"must add at least one non-YouTube URL in the Video File URLs field."
msgstr ""
"Laat studente toe om weergawes van hierdie video in verskillende formate af "
"te laai as hulle nie die edX-videospeler kan gebruik nie of nie toegang tot "
"YouTube het nie. Jy moet ten minste een nie-YouTube-URL in die Videolêer-"
"URL's-veld byvoeg."

#: video_xfields.py:85
msgid "Video Download Allowed"
msgstr "Video-aflaai toegelaat"

#: video_xfields.py:91
msgid ""
"The URL or URLs where you've posted non-YouTube versions of the video. Each "
"URL must end in .mpeg, .mp4, .ogg, or .webm and cannot be a YouTube URL. "
"(For browser compatibility, we strongly recommend .mp4 and .webm format.) "
"Students will be able to view the first listed video that's compatible with "
"the student's computer. To allow students to download these videos, set "
"Video Download Allowed to True."
msgstr ""
"Die URL of URL'e waar jy nie-YouTube weergawes van die video geplaas het. "
"Elke URL moet eindig op .mpeg, .mp4, .ogg of .webm en kan nie 'n YouTube-URL"
" wees nie. (Vir blaaierversoenbaarheid beveel ons .mp4- en .webm-formaat "
"sterk aan.) Studente sal die eerste gelyste video kan sien wat versoenbaar "
"is met die student se rekenaar. Om studente toe te laat om hierdie video's "
"af te laai, stel Video-aflaai toegelaat op Waar."

#: video_xfields.py:97
msgid "Video File URLs"
msgstr "Videolêer-URL's"

#: video_xfields.py:102
msgid ""
"By default, students can download an .srt or .txt transcript when you set "
"Download Transcript Allowed to True. If you want to provide a downloadable "
"transcript in a different format, we recommend that you upload a handout by "
"using the Upload a Handout field. If this isn't possible, you can post a "
"transcript file on the Files & Uploads page or on the Internet, and then add"
" the URL for the transcript here. Students see a link to download that "
"transcript below the video."
msgstr ""
"Studente kan by verstek 'n .srt- of .txt-transkripsie aflaai wanneer jy "
"Aflaai-transkripsie toegelaat op Waar stel. As jy 'n aflaaibare transkripsie"
" in 'n ander formaat wil verskaf, beveel ons aan dat jy 'n uitdeelstuk "
"oplaai deur die Laai 'n uitdeelstuk-veld op te gebruik. As dit nie moontlik "
"is nie, kan jy 'n transkripsielêer op die lêers en oplaaie-bladsy of op die "
"internet plaas, en dan die URL vir die transkripsie hier byvoeg. Studente "
"sien 'n skakel om daardie transkripsie af te laai onder die video."

#: video_xfields.py:108
msgid "Downloadable Transcript URL"
msgstr "Aflaaibare transkripsie-URL"

#: video_xfields.py:114
msgid ""
"Allow students to download the timed transcript. A link to download the file"
" appears below the video. By default, the transcript is an .srt or .txt "
"file. If you want to provide the transcript for download in a different "
"format, upload a file by using the Upload Handout field."
msgstr ""
"Laat studente toe om die tydgeskrewe transkripsie af te laai. 'n Skakel om "
"die lêer af te laai verskyn onder die video. By verstek is die transkripsie "
"'n .srt- of .txt-lêer. As jy die transkripsie vir aflaai in 'n ander formaat"
" wil verskaf, laai 'n lêer op deur die Oplaai-uitdeelstuk-veld te gebruik."

#: video_xfields.py:118
msgid "Download Transcript Allowed"
msgstr "Aflaai Transkripsie toegelaat"

#: video_xfields.py:126
msgid ""
"The default transcript for the video, from the Default Timed Transcript "
"field on the Basic tab. This transcript should be in English. You don't have"
" to change this setting."
msgstr ""
"Die verstektranskripsie vir die video, vanaf die Verstek Tydige "
"Transkripsie-veld op die Basiese-oortjie. Hierdie transkripsie moet in "
"Engels wees. Jy hoef nie hierdie instelling te verander nie."

#: video_xfields.py:129
msgid "Default Timed Transcript"
msgstr "Verstek Tydige transkripsie"

#: video_xfields.py:134
msgid "Specify whether the transcripts appear with the video by default."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer of die transkripsies by verstek saam met die video verskyn."

#: video_xfields.py:135
msgid "Show Transcript"
msgstr "Wys transkripsie"

#: video_xfields.py:142
msgid ""
"Add transcripts in different languages. Click below to specify a language "
"and upload an .srt transcript file for that language."
msgstr ""
"Voeg transkripsies in verskillende tale by. Klik hieronder om 'n taal te "
"spesifiseer en laai 'n .srt-transkripsielêer vir daardie taal op."

#: video_xfields.py:145
msgid "Transcript Languages"
msgstr "Transkripsietale"

#: video_xfields.py:150
msgid "Preferred language for transcript."
msgstr "Voorkeurtaal vir transkripsie."

#: video_xfields.py:151
msgid "Preferred language for transcript"
msgstr "Voorkeurtaal vir transkripsie"

#: video_xfields.py:156
msgid "Transcript file format to download by user."
msgstr "Transkripsie lêerformaat om af te laai deur gebruiker."

#. Translators: This is a type of file used for captioning in the video
#. player.
#: video_xfields.py:160
msgid "SubRip (.srt) file"
msgstr "SubRip (.srt) lêer"

#: video_xfields.py:161
msgid "Text (.txt) file"
msgstr "Teks (.txt) lêer"

#: video_xfields.py:165
msgid "The last speed that the user specified for the video."
msgstr "Die laaste spoed wat die gebruiker vir die video gespesifiseer het."

#: video_xfields.py:166
msgid "The default speed for the video."
msgstr "Die verstekspoed vir die video."

#: video_xfields.py:168
msgid ""
"Specify whether to advance automatically to the next unit when the video "
"ends."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer of jy outomaties na die volgende eenheid gaan wanneer die video "
"eindig."

#: video_xfields.py:177
msgid "Specify whether YouTube is available for the user."
msgstr "Spesifiseer of YouTube vir die gebruiker beskikbaar is."

#: video_xfields.py:181
msgid ""
"Upload a handout to accompany this video. Students can download the handout "
"by clicking Download Handout under the video."
msgstr ""
"Laai 'n uitdeelstuk op om hierdie video te vergesel. Studente kan die "
"uitdeelstuk aflaai deur Laai uitdeelstuk af onder die video af te klik."

#: video_xfields.py:184
msgid "Upload Handout"
msgstr "Laai uitdeelstuk op"

#: video_xfields.py:189
msgid ""
"Specify whether access to this video is limited to browsers only, or if it "
"can be accessed from other applications including mobile apps."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer of toegang tot hierdie video slegs tot blaaiers beperk is, of "
"dat dit vanaf ander toepassings, insluitend mobiele toepassings, verkry kan "
"word."

#: video_xfields.py:192
msgid "Video Available on Web Only"
msgstr "Video Slegs op die web beskikbaar"

#: video_xfields.py:198
msgid ""
"If you were assigned a Video ID by edX for the video to play in this "
"component, enter the ID here. In this case, do not enter values in the "
"Default Video URL, the Video File URLs, and the YouTube ID fields. If you "
"were not assigned a Video ID, enter values in those other fields and ignore "
"this field."
msgstr ""
"As jy 'n video-ID deur edX toegeken is vir die video om in hierdie komponent"
" te speel, voer die ID hier in. In hierdie geval moet u nie waardes in die "
"verstekvideo-URL, die videolêer-URL's en die YouTube-ID-velde invoer nie. As"
" jy nie 'n video-ID toegeken is nie, voer waardes in daardie ander velde in "
"en ignoreer hierdie veld."

#: video_xfields.py:203
msgid "Video ID"
msgstr "Video ID"

#: video_xfields.py:208
msgid "Date of the last view of the bumper"
msgstr "Datum van die laaste aansig van die buffer"

#: video_xfields.py:212
msgid "Do not show bumper again"
msgstr "Moenie weer bumper wys nie"

#: video_xfields.py:217
msgid "Specify whether the video can be accessed publicly by learners."
msgstr "Spesifiseer of die video publiek deur leerders verkry kan word."

#: video_xfields.py:218
msgid "Public Access"
msgstr "Publieke Toegang"

#: video_xfields.py:225
msgid "Add a specific thumbnail for learners to see before playing the video."
msgstr ""
"Voeg 'n spesifieke kleinkiekie by wat leerders kan sien voordat hulle die "
"video speel."

#: video_xfields.py:226
msgid "Thumbnail"
msgstr "Kleinkiekie"

